IBM Cloud Security Assessment

Executive Introduction

This assessment summarizes the Singapore Land Authority cloud security incident and the related IBM platform vulnerabilities in a format that is easier to scan and aligned to an executive-oriented structure. It preserves the underlying technical detail while reorganizing the content into a clearer incident summary followed by the most relevant IBM vulnerability findings. [ibm](https://www.ibm.com/support/pages/node/7276600)

